<td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
<pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#79c0ff">### 需求完整性 
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#79c0ff"></span><span style="color:#ff7b72">- [ ]</span> 无 [需要澄清] 标记 
